 {
  "coord": "2:3",
  "verdict": "FAIL",
  "category": "reversal",
  "note": "Source hopes no biting winds blow at home; candidate says \"I'm afraid\" none may blow.",
  "replacement": "POLIXENES. Sir, that's tomorrow. My fears question me about what may happen or grow up while we're away. I pray no biting winds blow at home, so we won't have to say, \"This worry was too true.\" Besides, I've stayed long enough to tire your royal self."
 },
