  "coord": "2:81",
  "verdict": "FAIL",
  "category": "reversal",
  "note": "\"that\" means the slander just spoken; candidate makes it the adulterous act itself.",
  "replacement": "CAMILLO. I would not stand by and hear my sovereign mistress slandered without taking vengeance on the spot. Curse my heart, you never said anything that suited you less than this. To repeat it would be as deep a sin as saying it, even if it were true."
 },
